Sam, how do I explain Eye of Sauron?
萨姆，我该怎么解释索伦之眼？

1247
00:49:18.340 --> 00:49:20.000
I think it was, it was a person.
我觉得它曾是一个人。

1248
00:49:20.000 --> 00:49:22.880
It was a person and he's gaining his power back.
他曾是一个人，而且他正在恢复力量。

1249
00:49:23.140 --> 00:49:23.640
And then he'll be.
然后他就会……

1250
00:49:23.680 --> 00:49:25.140
If he gets to the ring, then he can be a person again.
如果他拿到戒指，他就能重新变成人。

1251
00:49:25.160 --> 00:49:29.520
Then he can be fully complete and he will reign pure hell all over the land.
这样他就彻底完整了，他会在整片土地上掀起纯粹的地狱。

1252
00:49:30.300 --> 00:49:30.740
So.
所以。

1253
00:49:30.740 --> 00:49:36.460
See, your difficulty in explaining it to me is why I don't like to watch it.
你看，你很难向我解释清楚，这就是我不想看它的原因。

1254
00:49:36.560 --> 00:49:37.280
