So why does Dwight want to go there?
那德怀特为什么想去那儿？

1267
00:49:54.580 --> 00:49:56.980
I mean, there's like lava fields and all this kind of craziness.
我的意思是，那里有熔岩田和诸如此类的疯狂景象。

1268
00:49:57.360 --> 00:49:58.620
And then hike Mount Doom.
然后还要去爬末日火山。

1269
00:49:58.780 --> 00:50:01.080
I think Dwight is like a huge Lord of the Rings fan.
我觉得德怀特就像是个超级《指环王》迷。

1270
00:50:01.280 --> 00:50:03.840
He basically wants to be one of the Lord of the Rings.
他基本上是想成为《指环王》里的人物之一。

1271
00:50:04.080 --> 00:50:06.840
He wants to be on this journey and adventure.
他想经历这番旅程和冒险。

1272
00:50:07.120 --> 00:50:07.880
Let me ask you this.
我问你个问题。

1273
00:50:08.000 --> 00:50:09.900
But it's filmed in New Zealand and it's gorgeous.
但它是在新西兰拍摄的，景色美极了。

1274
00:50:09.900 --> 00:50:11.000
So I would love to go.
所以我很想去。

1275
00:50:11.280 --> 00:50:16.560
Is, are they the Lords of the Rings because it's their job to keep the rings from the
他们是戒指之王，因为他们的工作是保护戒指不让索伦的

1276
00:50:16.560 --> 00:50:17.800
eye of Swarzin?
眼睛看到吗？

1277
