Oh, good God.
哦，天哪。

1278
00:50:19.320 --> 00:50:21.880
Or because they want to get the ring to him.
还是因为他们想把戒指送到他那儿去。

1279
00:50:22.060 --> 00:50:22.440
No.
不对。

1280
00:50:22.440 --> 00:50:24.080
So he turns into a regular person again.
所以他会重新变成一个普通人。

1281
00:50:24.280 --> 00:50:24.500
No.
不对。

1282
00:50:24.840 --> 00:50:28.460
First of all, are you trying to say it wrong?
首先，你是故意说错的吗？

1283
00:50:28.700 --> 00:50:29.440
No, I don't.
不，我没有。

1284
00:50:29.920 --> 00:50:30.400
Swarzin?
索伦？

1285
00:50:30.600 --> 00:50:31.080
Swarzin.
索伦。

1286
00:50:31.500 --> 00:50:31.980
Swarzin.
索伦。

1287
00:50:32.140 --> 00:50:32.620
Swarzin.
索伦。

1288
00:50:33.200 --> 00:50:35.780
This is like Carl all over again.
这简直就像卡尔那件事重演了一样。

1289
00:50:37.960 --> 00:50:38.440
Okay.
好吧。

1290
00:50:39.120 --> 00:50:40.160
Moving on.
言归正传。

1291
00:50:40.360 --> 00:50:41.140
Moving on.
下一个。

1292
00:50:41.280 --> 00:50:42.940
11 minutes, three seconds.
11分零3秒。

