This is one of the first in a while.
这是好久以来的第一次。

1298
00:50:50.760 --> 00:50:52.320
Normally they do pranks together.
通常他们都是一起恶作剧的。

1299
00:50:52.720 --> 00:50:53.600
This is a good point.
这倒是个好点。

1300
00:50:53.600 --> 00:50:54.740
They're in cahoots.
他们是一伙的。

1301
00:50:54.920 --> 00:50:55.000
Yeah.
